usage: rebis.gene-pipeline [-h] [--test] [--dna DNA] [--seq SEQ] [--pdb PDB]
                           [--file FILE] [--stdin]

DNA → Folded Protein — 7-stage Frobenius-verified translation

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --test                Run demo/self-test
  --dna DNA             DNA sequence
  --seq SEQ             RNA sequence (alias for --dna)
  --pdb PDB             Output PDB structure file path
  --file FILE, -f FILE  Input file (JSON or FASTA/sequence)
  --stdin, -i           Read JSON arguments from stdin
